#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:4
#: e582843379264cd79a93a611bf18e501
msgid "ESC calibration"
msgstr "ESC 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:6
#: c8eb5fb321024e35b33e16bba1683702
msgid ""
"Most models of PWM based ESC need to be calibrated to ensure that all the "
"ESCs respond to the same input with the same speed. To calibrate them they "
"need to receive maximum PWM input when initially powered on, then receive "
"minimum PWM input when they have beeped to indicate that the maximum has "
"registered."
msgstr ""
"大多数基于 PWM 的 ESC 需要校准，以确保所有 ESC 对相同输入以相同转速响应。校准时需要在初始上电时接收最大 PWM 输入，然后在 ESC "
"发出提示音表示已记录最大值后接收最小 PWM 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:14
#: 6d699116eb4640899ce75f058e87d01a
msgid ""
"You must remove all propellers from your vehicle before doing any ESC "
"calibration. Calibrating with propellers installed is dangerous."
msgstr "进行任何 ESC 校准前，必须从飞行器上拆下所有螺旋桨。带螺旋桨进行校准是危险的。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:18
#: 63f3c91c3ab44a87b1dc8040c28e0b7d
msgid "ESC Calibration Procedure"
msgstr "ESC 校准流程"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:19
#: ce8d51e1708f4250b85c7199545e67b9
msgid ""
"This process uses the :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL <Q_ESC_CAL>` parameter to enable ESC "
"calibration in QSTABILIZE mode. There are two modes of operation available:"
msgstr ""
"此流程使用 :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL <Q_ESC_CAL>` 参数在 QSTABILIZE 模式下启用 ESC 校准。有两种可用的操作模式："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:23
#: cdbbe1b04d8f46cabd8ad5a9be07f084
msgid ""
"with Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 the output to the motors will come directly from the "
"throttle stick in QSTABILIZE mode when the vehicle is armed"
msgstr "设置 Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 时，在 QSTABILIZE 模式下解锁后，电机输出将直接由油门摇杆控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:25
#: c1f8d24a602d48b39aa15c1527c31f55
msgid ""
"with Q\\_ESC_CAL=2 the output to the motors will be full throttle when the "
"motors are armed"
msgstr "设置 Q\\_ESC_CAL=2 时，解锁后所有四旋翼电机的输出将为最大油门。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:28
#: 064371b5ecca4cb6bf2a521ddb43f97e
msgid "The process when using Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 is"
msgstr "使用 Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 的操作流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:30
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:49
#: bd6f8c13d1a642d281e330c74f98f146 f4b5a756792c45ebbbd5fb116f6be0e4
msgid "remove your propellers for safety"
msgstr "为安全起见，拆下螺旋桨。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:31
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:50
#: 568ecb69d6e345f2b5d0bf359ee8cf99 ee3b6a1157b947fdbd9d9050b17d79df
msgid ""
"power up just the flight board and not your motors. If you don't have the "
"ability to isolate power to the ESCs when on battery power then power up "
"your flight board on USB power"
msgstr "仅上电给飞控板，不给电机上电。如果无法在使用电池供电时单独隔离 ESC 的电源，则通过 USB 给飞控板供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:34
#: 1244e8dfd3eb4ebdb69d1798d0db2ad3
msgid "set the Q\\_ESC_CAL parameter to 1"
msgstr "将 Q\\_ESC_CAL 参数设为1。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:35
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:54
#: 49417724faac494fb9bb107374d0517f 8ce14e5799844c0c888a10a85435c11e
msgid "change to QSTABILIZE mode"
msgstr "切换到 QSTABILIZE 模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:36
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:55
#: b57cdcc03bd14ef686b50a91ea301094 f14a0648eb1b4d969e9b1b0ea937b046
msgid "set the safety switch off to activate the outputs"
msgstr "关闭安全开关以激活输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:37
#: ace202700e454e2f8bd763d324bb86a0
msgid ""
"arm your aircraft. The PWM output on all quad motors will now be controlled "
"by your throttle stick"
msgstr "解锁飞行器。所有四旋翼电机的 PWM 输出现在将由您的油门摇杆控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:39
#: 9cfe41494bb549a0b651fdbb2065d3ab
msgid "move the throttle stick to maximum"
msgstr "将油门摇杆推至最大。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:40
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:57
#: 19fb00ac2eae41a3b592be7680951b54 ce6b230ff18a4b5a9d3374614b7cdead
msgid "add power to your ESCs by connecting the battery"
msgstr "通过连接电池为 ESC 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:58
#: 1f0ad5012c5f4971b7d5db72b452ff8c a02722b9e2e4417f8c5df74289898f12
msgid ""
"wait for the ESCs to beep to indicate they have registered the maximum PWM"
msgstr "等待 ESC 发出提示音，表示已记录最大 PWM 值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:43
#: 1dd61e5329b84d68b20b4661b86b8939
msgid "lower the throttle stick to zero and disarm your aircraft"
msgstr "将油门摇杆拉至最低并上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:44
#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:61
#: 09bcc1b7e2cb4fa89ca75c7c6320603d 9eaa8e447a5444f8b035b40d270cf536
msgid ""
"you should hear a beep from your ESCs to indicate they have registered the "
"throttle range"
msgstr "您应该听到 ESC 发出提示音，表示已记录油门范围。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:47
#: 85581111d56b40dcb25487bb48f6dea3
msgid "The process when using Q\\_ESC\\_CAL=2 is"
msgstr "使用 Q\\_ESC\\_CAL=2 的操作流程如下："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:53
#: 197f8e2b1b7d41b59c960cefd90b1757
msgid "set the Q\\_ESC_CAL parameter to 2"
msgstr "将 Q\\_ESC_CAL 参数设为2。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:56
#: 44e7c7f180524495bc50bb5f725870cf
msgid ""
"arm your aircraft. The PWM output on all quad motors will now be at maximum"
msgstr "解锁飞行器。所有四旋翼电机的 PWM 输出现在将为最大值。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:60
#: d906a6116a594c488917cb8d09267619
msgid "disarm your aircraft"
msgstr "上锁飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:64
#: 9e540bbec4fe401f910cec1f235fe1dc
msgid ""
"Note that using Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 can be useful for testing your motors "
"response. This is the only mode when you are able to directly control the "
"throttle level on all your motors at once. While in this mode you can use a "
"laser tachometer to test your motor speeds at different throttle levels if "
"you have one."
msgstr ""
"注意，Q\\_ESC_CAL=1 "
"可用于测试电机响应，这是唯一可以同时直接控制所有电机油门级别的模式。在此模式下，如果您有激光转速表，可以测试不同油门级别下的电机转速。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-esc-calibration.rst:70
#: 87c206409ecf4c2cae0e819913528fc9
msgid ""
"Be sure to set :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL<Q_ESC_CAL>` back to zero after calibrating "
"for normal operation"
msgstr "校准完成后，请务必将 :ref:`Q_ESC_CAL<Q_ESC_CAL>` 重新设为零以恢复正常操作。"
